    <org:hasName>Do you provide formal or/and informal ways for your clients/customers to inform your product design, decision making, etc.?</org:hasName>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Do you provide formal or/and informal ways for your clients/customers to inform your product design, decision making, etc.?</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Offrez-vous à vos clients des moyens formels ou/et informels d'influencer la conception de vos produits, la prise de décision etc. ?</skos:prefLabel>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Do you provide formal or/and informal ways for your clients/customers to inform your product design, decision making, etc.?</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="fr">Offrez-vous à vos clients des moyens formels ou/et informels d'influencer la conception de vos produits, la prise de décision etc. ?</rdfs:label>
    <cids:hasDescription>Leadership of the social purpose organization is informed by participatory processes from the lived experience of target clients/customers from equity-deserving groups.</cids:hasDescription>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Leadership of the social purpose organization is informed by participatory processes from the lived experience of target clients/customers from equity-deserving groups.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="fr">Le leadership de l'organisme à vocation sociale met en place des processus participatifs pour tenir compte de l'expérience vécue des clients ciblés provenant des groupes méritant l'équité.</skos:definition>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Leadership of the social purpose organization is informed by participatory processes from the lived experience of target clients/customers from equity-deserving groups.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="fr">Le leadership de l'organisme à vocation sociale met en place des processus participatifs pour tenir compte de l'expérience vécue des clients ciblés provenant des groupes méritant l'équité.</rdfs:comment>
